      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "23, NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang visited Astana, meeting with President Kassym-Jomart Tokayev at the Akorda Presidential Palace and joining Deputy Prime Minister Zhaslan Madiyev — Kazakhstan’s minister of AI and digital development — for a public fireside chat at the Al…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Jensen Huang and Kazakhstan’s AI Minister Speak at Alem.AI",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In their fireside chat at Alem.AI, Kazakhstan’s international center for artificial intelligence, Madiyev and Huang discussed the country’s push to become an AI nation — building the energy and computing infrastructure to support homegrown AI and applying it across the economy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Madiyev said Kazakhstan wants AI that reflects its language and culture.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Building on its first AI factory in Armenia, Firebird is expanding into Kazakhstan, where it has secured a U.S. export license for 45,000 NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GPUs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The first phase is under construction with Kazakhtelecom at Data Center Valley, targeting commercial launch in the third quarter of 2027.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A planned second phase would bring Firebird’s total potential AI infrastructure capacity in Kazakhstan to approximately 500 megawatts.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Firebird also plans to establish Firebird Labs Kazakhstan to support local AI startups, research and talent development through funding, access to compute and research partnerships.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“What began as a seed of an idea 180 days ago has grown into a major investment in Kazakhstan’s AI future,” said Razmig Hovaghimian, co-Founder and CEO of Firebird.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:25.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today’s announcements represent different layers of the AI stack in Kazakhstan— infrastructure deployment, access to compute and AI-native product development — where the AI foundation is reaching new scale.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/kazakhstan-ai-compute-ecosystem/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
